      "mergedPostDetails": "Description\n\nTrigger will occasionally double click when only clicked once. (PS can you please add a way for us to change the ui back to the way it was.)\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nJust click the trigger on the mouse, its happens at random and will preform a double click with only a single click.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1919-27c41b24d2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-03_01-22-19.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_c0d3b8d7-88d4-474d-8084-634423dafd2b/1/file)",
